


Ijade kọ: ['Number:'].
>> a := Nọmba + Nọmba + 1.
a := Nọmba - 2.
a := Nọmba × 2.
a := Nọmba ÷ 2.
Ijade kọ: a.
Ijade ila-tuntun.

Ijade kọ: ['String:'].
Ijade kọ: Ọrọ gigun.
Ijade ila-tuntun.

Ijade kọ: ['File:'].
Ijade kọ: Faili ka.
Ijade kọ: (Faili kọ: ['test']).
Ijade kọ: (Faili fi-kun-opin: ['test']).
Ijade kọ: Faili paarẹ.
Ijade kọ: Faili wa.
Ijade kọ: Faili include.
Ijade kọ: Faili bẹrẹ.
Ijade ila-tuntun.


Ijade kọ: ['Array:'].
Ijade kọ: Akojọ gba-igbehin.
Ijade kọ: Akojọ iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: (((Akojọ fi-kun-opin: 999) ọrọ) rọpo: ['Lĳst'] pẹlu: ['List']).
Ijade kọ: Akojọ iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: Akojọ gba-akọkọ.
Ijade kọ: (Akojọ so-pọ: [',']).
>> f := Akojọ tuntun.
Ijade kọ: f iye-nọmba. 
Ijade ila-tuntun.

Ijade kọ: ['Map:'].
Ijade kọ: Atumọ-ede iye-nọmba.
Ijade kọ: (Atumọ-ede fi: ['a'] si: ['b'])  iye-nọmba. 
Ijade ila-tuntun.




